<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BPI prices capital call.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BPI prices capital call.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Portugues de Investimento said on Tuesday that its capital call to pay for the purchase of Banco de Fomento &amp; Exterior will be priced at 1,400 escudos per share.</p>
<p>The bank will issue 21.5 million shares.</p>
</text>
